---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: page-news page-lore
---
{#- 正史板块 lore 站文章详情。翻页只在正史集合内（含交叉列入的天书公告）按日期前后跳转。 -#}
{%- set prev = collections.lore | getPreviousCollectionItem(page) -%}
{%- set next = collections.lore | getNextCollectionItem(page) -%}
{%- set art = content | prepareArticle({ kind: 'news', toc: toc, tocDepth: tocDepth }) -%}
<div class="article-frame{% if art.hasToc %} has-toc{% endif %}">
  {% set backHref = "/lore/" %}{% set backLabel = "正史" %}{% include "back.njk" %}

  <article class="bio news lore{% if art.hasToc %} has-toc{% endif %}" data-pagefind-body data-pagefind-filter="板块:正史">
    <header class="news-head">
      <p class="news-meta">
        <a class="news-cat lore-col-site lore-col-{{ loreColumn.key }}" href="{{ '/lore/' | url }}?t={{ loreColumn.key }}" title="{{ loreColumn.en }}">{{ loreColumn.name }}</a>
        <time datetime="{{ published }}">{{ yc }}</time>
        <span class="news-origin">公历 {{ published }}</span>
        <span class="news-origin">{{ translationLabel }}</span>
      </p>
      <h1 class="news-title">{{ title }}</h1>
      <p class="news-title-en" lang="en">{{ titleEn }}</p>
      <p class="news-links" data-pagefind-ignore>
        <a href="{{ source }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官方原文 ↗</a>
      </p>
    </header>

    {% include "article-toc.njk" %}

    <div class="prose news-prose">
      {{ art.html | safe }}
    </div>

    <p class="news-credit" data-pagefind-ignore>原文与图片版权归 CCP Games 所有。本页由本站据英文原文翻译，以官方英文原文为准。</p>
  </article>

  <nav class="pager" aria-label="按发布时间翻页" data-pagefind-ignore>
    {% if prev %}<a class="pager-prev" href="{{ prev.url | url }}" rel="prev"><small>较新一篇</small>{{ prev.data.title }}</a>{% else %}<span></span>{% endif %}
    <a class="pager-random" href="{{ '/lore/' | url }}">目录</a>
    {% if next %}<a class="pager-next" href="{{ next.url | url }}" rel="next"><small>较早一篇</small>{{ next.data.title }}</a>{% else %}<span></span>{% endif %}
  </nav>
</div>
{% if art.hasToc or art.hasTabs %}<script src="{{ '/assets/js/article-ui.js' | url }}?v={{ site.build }}" defer></script>{% endif %}
